\chapter{Limitations \& Future Scope}

\section{Current Limitations}
\begin{itemize}[leftmargin=*]
    \item Trained on a single 5-class English corpus (BBC News, 2004--2005)
    \item Single-label classification only (no multi-label)
    \item Batch processing limited to CSV format
    \item No multilingual support
    \item No active learning or drift detection
\end{itemize}

\section{Future Enhancements}
\begin{enumerate}[leftmargin=*]
    \item \textbf{Multi-label classification} — allow articles to belong to multiple domains.
    \item \textbf{Multilingual support} — leverage XLM-RoBERTa for cross-lingual news categorization.
    \item \textbf{Active learning} — prioritize uncertain samples for human review and retraining.
    \item \textbf{Real-time ingestion} — RSS/API integration for live news streams.
    \item \textbf{Attention visualization} — display token-level attention from DistilBERT for deeper explainability.
    \item \textbf{Model compression} — quantize DistilBERT for edge deployment.
\end{enumerate}

